  m_text: "Before your child can use the\_**AR Sana App**, please review the following:\r\n\r\n1.
    The app is designed for children, and some sections are available only to parents,
    guardians,\_**speech therapists, and therapy centers**\_(with parental permission).\r\n2.
    The microphone is used only for sound-based exercises (e.g., blowing, phonemes).\r\n   
    \r\n    **No voice recordings or personal audio data are stored or shared.Only
    short sound signals may be processed to improve Sana\u2019s recognition accuracy.**\r\n   
    \r\n3. The app collects\_**minimal progress data**\_(levels, stars, exercises).\r\n   
    \r\n    **No photos, videos, or personally identifiable information are collected.**\r\n   
    \r\n4. The app contains no ads and does not share data with third parties for
    marketing.\r\n5. Consent may be withdrawn at any time, and stored data may be
    deleted upon request.\r\n\r\nBy selecting\_**\u201CI Agree\u201D**, you confirm
    that you are a parent or legal guardian and allow your child to use the app under
    your supervision."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85c33b1fdc2483a4280be0824f6448a5, type: 2}
